
  Rank 4 fork(s) by intent

  Intent: > terminal_

  scorer: lexical (set VOYAGE_AI_API_KEY for the cross-encoder)
  [ctrl+c] Quit [Enter] Apply ranking (empty clears) [Esc] Cancel ranking [left/ctrl+b] Move input cursor left
[right/ctrl+f] Move input cursor right [home/ctrl+a] Move input cursor to start [end/ctrl+e] Move input cursor to end
[backspace] Delete previous character [delete] Delete next character [ctrl+u] Clear input
